{"title":"What should I ask Katja Hoyer?","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/949013570/0/marginalrevolution~What-should-I-ask-Katja-Hoyer.html","date":1772380118000,"content":"<p>Yes I will be doing a Conversation with her.  She is the author of a forthcoming book on Weimar, namely <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Weimar-Life-Catastrophe-Katja-Hoyer/dp/1541605799/ref=sr_1_1?crid=FFNC9FV1FRE8&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.qWcjf-taTF6F6JFmbg-Qmz1Ttriw6MvoeXVYVnQjIE-NjEXEZU-hNquntqp259TwWfeAj7Fp14miWK6yteogbg.LJ6ZO80aU2L-SKUIboCnsIpQBz-MrJLNLMy9WSm6HSI&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=katja+hoyer+weimar&amp;qid=1772312908&amp;sprefix=katja+hoyer%2Caps%2C218&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">Weimar: Life on the Edge of Catastrophe</a>.  Note that much of the book considers the city of Weimar, mostly in Nazi times, and not just the Weimar era.  She also has published <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Beyond-Wall-History-East-Germany/dp/1541606361/ref=tmm_pap_swatch_0?_encoding=UTF8&amp;dib_tag=AUTHOR&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.DXDex5aPztmRcM0kq461Rmjxj41KzZkziKuGrAN8XgafxTJRsJkL2upU07Xrz5iM-8bPV2xcs3IIEk4DPzHoiyuwqP_1I1_mThqI5ZiA5zY7r8-1QaMi-M-tLXwMEoHvxzNcv2VW3z-oW8g9f4ll7w.MeKIYjLbmYuKgRAIzA-YER1QdzNYMp4B-aUNXgrluak\" target=\"_blank\">Beyond the Wall: A History of East Germany</a>, and <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Blood-Iron-Rise-German-Empire/dp/1639362975/ref=tmm_pap_swatch_0\" target=\"_blank\">Blood and Iron: The Rise and Fall of the German Empire 1871-1918</a>.  She is active in journalism, podcasting, and is a visiting research fellow at King’s College London.  She was born in East Germany and is both British and German.</p>\r\n<p>So what should I ask her?</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/03/what-should-i-ask-katja-hoyer.html\">What should I ask Katja Hoyer?</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/949013570/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/949013570/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/949013570/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/949013570/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/949013570/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/949013570/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/03/what-should-i-ask-katja-hoyer.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/03/what-should-i-ask-katja-hoyer.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a> \r\n<div><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/03/what-should-i-ask-katja-hoyer.html#comments\"><h3>Comments</h3></a><ul><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/03/what-should-i-ask-katja-hoyer.html#comment-161021800\">Ask about this:   How the tendrils of prior German political ...</a> <i>by Atom</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/03/what-should-i-ask-katja-hoyer.html#comment-161021798\">In reply to Alamo.   That part is hard to believe.</a>